-/// from `inherit`; if `ignore_default_excludes` is false, drop the secret
-/// patterns `*KEY*`/`*SECRET*`/`*TOKEN*`; drop `exclude`; insert `set`; if
-/// `include_only` is non-empty, keep only those. Patterns are case-insensitive
